{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51103","headline":"酬杨赡秀才送别 · 崔致远","name":"酬杨赡秀才送别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海槎虽定隔年廻，衣锦还乡愧不才。\n暂别芜城当叶落，远寻蓬岛趂花开。\n谷鸎遥想高飞去，（原注：时杨生有随计〖高丽本计作行〗之计。\n）辽豕宁慙再献来。\n好把壮心谋後会，广陵风月待衔杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}